{UTF-8}
{ Chapter 2: writing equations with units. A stock of spare parts that becomes obsolete at 10% a week. }
Obsolescence Fraction=
	0.1
	~	1/week
	~	Share of the parts on hand that becomes obsolete each week.
	|
Receipts=
	STEP(30, 20)
	~	parts/week
	~	No receipts until week 20, then 30 parts a week.
	|
Obsolescence=
	Parts On Hand * Obsolescence Fraction
	~	parts/week
	~	|
Parts On Hand= INTEG(
	Receipts - Obsolescence,
	1000)
	~	parts
	~	|
INITIAL TIME = 0 ~ week ~ |
FINAL TIME = 60 ~ week ~ |
TIME STEP = 0.125 ~ week ~ |
SAVEPER = 0.125 ~ week ~ |
